  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Bulk Operations (Tindakan Massal)",
      "id": "bulk-operations",
      "intro": "Alert Issuer dilengkapi dengan berbagai fitur tindakan massal untuk mempercepat kerja analis saat memproses banyak alert dengan karakteristik serupa secara bersamaan.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Akses Menu Bulk",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik ikon **Tiga Titik (More Actions)** di toolbar atas tabel untuk melihat daftar tindakan massal yang tersedia.\n• Mode bulk yang tersedia meliputi:\n  - **Bulk Classification** (Mengklasifikasi fraud massal)\n  - **Bulk Assign** (Menugaskan banyak alert ke analis baru)\n  - **Bulk Reassign** (Mengalihkan alert dari analis satu ke lainnya)\n  - **Bulk Lock & Unlock** (Manajemen kunci akses massal)\n• Mengklik salah satu opsi akan mengubah tampilan tabel menjadi mode seleksi (Selection Mode).",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;width:240px;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"padding:8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;cursor:pointer;\">Bulk Classification</div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"/></svg>Bulk Assign</div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M18 8l3 3-3 3\"/><path d=\"M15 11h6\"/></svg>Bulk Reassign</div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;margin:4px 0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg>Lock</div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1\"/></svg>Unlock</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Mode Seleksi (Selection Bar)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Saat salah satu mode diaktifkan, tabel secara otomatis menyaring data yang tidak relevan (misal: fitur Bulk Lock hanya akan menampilkan alert yang belum dilock).\n• Sebuah **Action Bar** akan muncul di atas tabel, berisi tombol `Cancel` dan tombol eksekusi seperti `Classify Selected (N)` di mana N adalah jumlah alert yang Anda centang.\n• Anda dapat memilih semua alert di halaman tersebut sekaligus dengan mencentang checkbox master di header tabel.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(16,185,129,.15);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Classification Mode</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Classify Selected (5)</button></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:16px;height:16px;accent-color:#2563eb;\"/><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12345 - E-Commerce</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Progress Bar Eksekusi & Bulk History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Eksekusi bulk operations bisa memakan waktu lama. Proses ini dilakukan asinkron oleh server.\n• Khusus untuk **Bulk Classification**, sistem akan memunculkan notifikasi sukses membuat _bulk request_. \n• Anda dapat melacak progres klasifikasi massal ini melalui **Bulk Request History Drawer** (dapat diakses dari menu opsi titik tiga -> Bulk History).\n• Untuk Bulk Assign/Reassign/Lock/Unlock, notifikasi toast sukses/gagal parsial akan muncul seketika.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,.15);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:#fff;padding:16px;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#14532d;margin-bottom:2px;\">Partial Success</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#166534;line-height:1.4;\">8 alerts assigned, 2 failed.<br/>Failed IDs: 12349, 12350</div></div></div><button style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"12 8 12 12 14 14\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg>View Bulk History</button></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
